ok - fm-control relaunch: a same-harness relaunch replaces the agent in the same endpoint and worktree
skip - herdr Pi relaunch needs the pi CLI (fm-spawn.sh resolves a real pi executable on PATH even under the herdr fake)
ok - reclaim: a herdr pane that outlived its stopped server is adopted, never orphaned beside a new tab
final_exit=0
remaining_fixture_or_registry_paths=[]
